    "files": [
      {
        "description": "SPSS dataset containing demographic data and questionnaire data. \nEducation level, timestamps and free text items have been removed for privacy reasons.\n\nID: participant ID\ncondition: 0 = control, 1= experimental\nDSM5: Diagnosis based on DSM-5 criteria\nFAS = Functionality appreciation scale (7-items)\nBAS = Body appreciation scal (10 items)\nEDE_Q= Eating disorder examination questionnaire (28 items)\nChEDE = score on adapted item from ChEDE for shape and weight overevaluation\nSBAS = State body appreciation (appreciation/ unappreciation for different and unique characteristics of body)\nSFS = State functionality appreciation (satisfied/ unsatisfied with body functionality)\nVAMS = mood (at this moment I feel happy - sad)\nSISES = Self-esteem (I have high self-esteem)\nSITV = State intention food restriction (Planning to eat less (1), planning to eat less caloric food (2))\nSAS = State appearance dissatisfaction (satisfied/ unsatisfied with appearance)\nSOL = State overevaluation shape\nSOG = State overevaluation weight\n\nmirror: item is reverse-coded",
